    keyPoints: ["Reproducibility", "Deterministic Splits", "Fair Comparisons"],
    idealAnswerEn: "To ensure reproducibility. Pseudorandom number generators in train/test splits, model weight initializations, and k-fold shuffling produce identical sequences across runs when seeded (e.g. `random_state=42`), allowing fair comparisons.",
